            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 1. La métaphore du sandwich (Pour comprendre le principe)",
            "start": 482,
            "end": 543
          },
          {
            "id": "p6",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Imagine que tu prépares des sandwichs jambon-fromage selon cette recette stricte :",
            "start": 545,
            "end": 627
          },
          {
            "id": "p7",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "> **2 tranches de pain + 1 tranche de jambon + 2 tranches de fromage = 1 sandwich**",
            "start": 628,
            "end": 711
          },
          {
            "id": "p8",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Si je te demande : *\"J'ai 10 tranches de pain, combien me faut-il de jambon et de fromage pour faire des sandwichs parfaits ?\"*",
            "start": 713,
            "end": 840
          },
          {
            "id": "p9",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Tu vas calculer instinctivement :",
            "start": 841,
            "end": 874
          },
          {
            "id": "p10",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Il te faut 5 tranches de jambon (la moitié du pain).",
            "start": 875,
            "end": 929
          },
          {
            "id": "p11",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Il te faut 10 tranches de fromage (autant que de pain).",
            "start": 930,
            "end": 987
          },
          {
            "id": "p12",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Tu obtiendras 5 sandwichs.",
            "start": 988,
            "end": 1016
          },
          {
            "id": "p13",
            "category": "ANALOGY",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Félicitations, **tu viens de faire de la stœchiométrie sans le savoir !** Tu as utilisé les proportions de la recette pour calculer les quantités nécessaires.",
            "start": 1018,
            "end": 1176
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The sandwich analogy accurately demonstrates fixed proportion calculations.",
          "errors": []
        }
      },
