            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 2. Du sandwich aux molécules",
            "start": 1183,
            "end": 1215
          },
          {
            "id": "p16",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "En chimie, c'est exactement la même chose. Sauf qu'au lieu de tranches de pain, on a des atomes ou des molécules.",
            "start": 1217,
            "end": 1330
          },
          {
            "id": "p17",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Prenons la fabrication de l'eau : l'hydrogène ($H_2$) réagit avec l'oxygène ($O_2$) pour donner de l'eau ($H_2O$).",
            "start": 1332,
            "end": 1446
          },
          {
            "id": "p18",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "L'équation chimique (la recette), c'est :",
            "start": 1448,
            "end": 1489
          },
          {
            "id": "p19",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$2 H_2 + 1 O_2 \\rightarrow 2 H_2O$$",
            "start": 1490,
            "end": 1526
          },
          {
            "id": "p20",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Les grands chiffres devant les molécules s'appellent les **coefficients stœchiométriques**. Ils te donnent la proportion :",
            "start": 1528,
            "end": 1650
          },
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Il te faut **2** paquets de dihydrogène pour **1** paquet de dioxygène.",
            "start": 1651,
            "end": 1724
          },
          {
            "id": "p22",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Cela te donnera **2** paquets d'eau.",
            "start": 1725,
            "end": 1763
          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Rien ne se perd, rien ne se crée (merci Lavoisier) : tu as 4 atomes de H et 2 atomes de O au début, tu as 4 atomes de H et 2 atomes de O à la fin. Tout est équilibré.",
            "start": 1765,
            "end": 1931
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The balanced equation for water formation, definition of stoichiometric coefficients, and reference to Lavoisier's conservation of mass are correct.",
          "errors": []
        }
      },
